# Per-element callee with a non-input read — refused (besluit 1-A weiger-grens)

A pure-function callee reads only its own inputs. `KamerNonInput`'s output reads
`tarief`, an INTERNAL variable (neither an input nor the accessed output), which
has no FunctionDef parameter to bind — a non-input read. Refused per element.

```catala
declaration scope KamerNonInput:
  input grondslag content integer
  internal tarief content integer
  output bedrag content integer

scope KamerNonInput:
  definition tarief equals 100
  definition bedrag equals grondslag + tarief

declaration scope Aanslag:
  input grondslagen content list of integer
  output totaal content integer

scope Aanslag:
  definition totaal equals
    combine all b
      among (map each g among grondslagen to (output of KamerNonInput with { -- grondslag: g }).bedrag)
      in acc initially 0 with (acc + b)
```
